WEBVTT

00:01.180 --> 00:05.320
Technology can tell us more than ever, so why is our health still a guessing game?

00:08.700 --> 00:14.320
You do everything you're supposed to, but disease can still creep up on you long before you feel it.

00:14.520 --> 00:20.520
We built Helios to provide the world's highest resolution picture of your body and health, now and into the future.

00:21.340 --> 00:26.380
After pioneering CRISPR diagnostics, we spent years teaching AI to decode how we age.

00:26.380 --> 00:34.500
Now we've turned that work into Helios, the system that shows you where your health is headed from a single drop of blood.

00:36.500 --> 00:39.540
It takes less than five minutes and you can do it anywhere.

00:39.860 --> 00:48.440
We measure over a thousand biomarkers to learn how your body is aging, how your organs are functioning, and your risk of developing disease decades into the future.

00:48.440 --> 00:53.360
Our AI agent helps you understand your results, builds you a personalized plan, and tracks

00:53.360 --> 00:57.440
your progress over time so you can control the trajectory of your health.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.900
And yes, we know tech has made big promises about a single drop of blood before.

01:02.140 --> 01:02.580
The difference?

01:02.880 --> 01:06.540
This technology has been validated by labs and companies around the world.

01:06.820 --> 01:07.980
Your body is telling a story.

01:08.220 --> 01:09.520
We've made a new way to listen.

01:09.800 --> 01:11.520
Find out with Helios.
